3/","text":"Open sourcing some great new video and image editing research updates with the latest release of our Segment Anything models, SAM 3 and SAM 3D.\n\nThese models will show up across different features on...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02jobA95H1s5HnwYAJmZGRcsYL4KmGK4Mu2cdrSaRiocFhPNuJAwbTDLBtGNjaDRTXl","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2192","post_id":"2192","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid0dfnSS1FSfXb3ooMcqFohmsTHzKGWpn3vfy81kQBbAuyHeF9uphZzzEkT55Cih3Qul","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-11-17","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/2192/","text":"Grateful for 20 years working alongside Chris Cox. He's a special person and it's inspiring to build things with him. Congrats on the milestone.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid0dfnSS1FSfXb3ooMcqFohmsTHzKGWpn3vfy81kQBbAuyHeF9uphZzzEkT55Cih3Qul","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2191","post_id":"2191","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02xVZDRco8JdA771CjBPeULDmL8QbBcDhrbozygU3DsBQke6wR1FRrxMkoNgSFG4nkl","published_at":null,"published_date":"2025-11-09","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/2191/","text":"Big night out 🥂","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02xVZDRco8JdA771CjBPeULDmL8QbBcDhrbozygU3DsBQke6wR1FRrxMkoNgSFG4nkl","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-2190","post